| Factor | ATS Happy Trails | CRC Joyous | SKA Divya Towers | Gaur Group |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Greater Noida West relevance | High | High | High | High |
| Residential positioning | High | High | High | High |
| Brand presence | High | High | Medium-High | High |
| Search competition potential | High | High | Medium | High |
| Target audience overlap | High | High | High | High |

## Competitive Strategy

The Google Ads campaign should not attempt to compete only on brand recognition.

Instead, the campaign should focus on:

1. High-intent search keywords
2. Project-specific searches
3. 3 BHK + Study searches
4. Greater Noida West location searches
5. Strong ad relevance
6. Clear site-visit calls to action
7. Negative keyword filtering
8. Continuous search-term optimization

## Conclusion

The Greater Noida West residential market is highly competitive. ATS Happy Trails therefore requires tightly themed ad groups and highly relevant advertisements to compete for qualified search traffic.
